{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"e5291ce0a481585324d87ff880609bc284ef71b9163b469eeef2bd33178c526c"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:8c46f0eb6be1e5716826a18d95ce3a488358b010d02b678e4788b56fa66be997","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"No, Caroline prefers counseling.","evidence":"[D7:5 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Mell! I'm still looking into counseling and mental health jobs. It's important to me that people have someone to talk to, and I want to help make that happen.\n[D7:9 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Caroline: Thanks so much, Mel! Seeing this pic just made me appreciate my love of reading even more. Books guide me, motivate me and help me discover who I am. They're a huge part of my journey, and this one's reminding me to keep going and never give up!","itemId":"urn:uuid:7249af0e-c0b8-5712-8bf0-927868a68f86","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:00e1088a4103b828d1418bdc218fcc8ac31d8e3f02db97bb2f342b646505c022","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Caroline pursue writing as a career option?","referenceAnswer":"LIkely no; though she likes reading, she wants to be a counselor","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"00e1088a4103b828d1418bdc218fcc8ac31d8e3f02db97bb2f342b646505c022"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}